, bash history, and victim paths, revealing ongoing operations. Infrastructure analysis showed consistent use of NameSilo registrations, Alibaba hosting, and Cloudflare fronting. Phishing campaigns included fake portals impersonating Venezuelan tax systems and Claude-Pro software. The operation demonstrates shared tooling common across Chinese APT groups, with TTPs overlapping multiple...","author_name":"AlienVault","modified":"2026-08-22T11:05:22.583000","created":"2026-07-23T11:57:13.677000","revision":3,"tlp":"white","public":1,"adversary":"JadeProx","indicators":[{"id":2199240667,"indicator":"CVE-2018-11511","type":"CVE","created":"2026-07-23T11:57:14","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":2913150854,"indicator":"CVE-2021-24139","type":"CVE","created":"2026-07-23T11:57:14","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":3060792866,"indicator":"CVE-2021-31755","type":"CVE","created":"2026-07-23T11:57:14","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":3213457989,"indicator":"CVE-2021-32305","type":"CVE","created":"2026-07-23T11:57:14","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":4048868923,"indicator":"b8053bcd04ce9d7d19c7f36830a9f26b","type":"FileHash-MD5","created":"2026-07-23T11:57:14","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":4048868949,"indicator":"3ba9a74f8faeff3de03e4c834f266582e2eb46a8","type":"FileHash-SHA1","created":"2026-07-23T11:57:14","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":4048868981,"indicator":"e82ecbe3823046a27d8c39cc0a4acb498f415549946c9ff0e241838b34ed5a21","type":"FileHash-SHA256","created":"2026-07-23T11:57:14","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":4284213201,"indicator":"sylverixstrategy.com","type":"do